  "APIProfile":       "Basic",
  "Description":      "Audio Scene Editing: composes Audio Objects into an Audio Scene, places them, and sets the listener's Point of View. One scene is open at a time. BASIC AND FULL ARE EXPLICIT on both sides, as for CAE-AOE: objects arrive as OSD-BAO or OSD-AUO, scenes as OSD-BAS or OSD-ASD, and the produced kind leaves on its own Port. Receives Audio Objects from CAE-AOE across the Topology; it does not call that AIM.",

